<title>USA: United Asset buys stake in Canadian firm.</title>
<headline>United Asset buys stake in Canadian firm.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Asset Management Corp on Wednesday said it agreed to acquire a 49 percent stake in a Canadian institutional investment management firm.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it expected to close acquisition of the interest in Lincluden Management Ltd of Ontario in the third quarter.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the terms of the deal but said Lincluden managed C$6.2 billion (US$4.5 billion) in equity, fixed-income and balanced accounts.</p>
<p>United Asset Management provides investment management services, primarily to institutional investors.</p>
</text>
